OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer to combat homes pumping
OL,4,Asewage into rivers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dedicated officer is to be hired in
OL,7,Fwest London in a trial to combat the
OL,8,Fproblem of water-polluting
OL,9,Fmisconnections.
OL,11,FOwing to incorrect plumbing, affected
OL,12,Fhouseholds pump waste into surface
OL,13,Fdrains, which can then spread, killing
OL,14,Fwildlife and damaging waterways.
OL,16,FMisconnections are illegal, and fixing
OL,17,Fthem is the responsibility of the
OL,18,Fproperty owner.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
