OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer to combat homes pumping
OL,4,Asewage into rivers
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal authorities can take enforcement
OL,7,Faction, and if the pilot - funded by
OL,8,Fthe mayor of London's office - is
OL,9,Fsuccessful, the measure could be rolled
OL,10,Fout across the capital.
